@startuml 09-state-preserving-fork-choice
!theme plain

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #263238
  LifeLineBorderColor #455A64
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantFontColor #102027
}
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor<<commit>> #D1C4E9
  BackgroundColor<<latest>> #BBDEFB
  BackgroundColor<<choice>> #FFE082
  BackgroundColor<<closure>> #C8E6C9
  BackgroundColor<<replay>> #B2DFDB
  BackgroundColor<<block>> #FFECB3
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #F57F17
}
skinparam defaultFontName "monospace"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title Causal parent retention with certified-floor replay

participant "Captured LFB\nF" as LFB <<commit>>
participant "Valid latest messages\n{P1, P2, D}" as Latest <<latest>>
participant "Estimator and\ndirect parents" as Choice <<choice>>
participant "Parent causal\nclosure" as Closure <<closure>>
participant "Deterministic\nmerge replay" as Replay <<replay>>
participant "Proposed block" as Block <<block>>

Latest -[#1565C0]> Choice : retain every valid tip\nas fork-choice evidence
Choice -[#2E7D32]> Closure : direct parents are reachability-maximal\nevery valid tip is covered
Closure -[#2E7D32]> Replay : all above-floor causal inputs
LFB -[#1565C0]> Replay : protected floor state
Replay -[#2E7D32]> Block : floor state + accepted deltas\nexactly reject conflicting deltas
Choice -[#2E7D32]> Block : declare compact direct parents

note over Latest, Block
Stale or effect-dropping tips remain causal evidence. Replay decides their
above-floor effects deterministically; no such rejection may erase an effect
already represented by the certified floor.
end note

Latest -[#546E7A]> Choice : alternate snapshot has no valid tip
LFB -[#F57C00]> Choice : exact fallback parent = F
Choice -[#2E7D32]> Block : declare {F}

@enduml
